    load(fast) //IC of load: [{ slot: 0, icType: LOAD, value: MONO(A) }]  --> Fast
    load(slow) //IC of load: [{ slot: 0, icType: LOAD, value: POLY[A,B] }]  --> Slow. Now it needs to check 2 shapes. 
